- D</i>)\n</p><p><br>\nFrontline war report - <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Duke Ravengard</a>\n</p><p><br>\nComponent pouches - <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a>\n</p><p><br>\nRefugee letters - <a href=\"/wiki/Yannis\" title=\"Yannis\">Rector Yannis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple\" title=\"Open Hand Temple\">Open Hand Temple</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Posthouse apology missives refers to all people who filed complaints in <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Post_House_Delivery_Complaints\" title=\"Post House Delivery Complaints\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Post_House_Delivery_Complaints\" title=\"Post House Delivery Complaints\">Post House Delivery Complaints</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055409\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1585/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27522/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argumen